Repairs

14:30.340 --> 14:31.540
You want to come all the way back here?

14:31.540 --> 14:32.870
That'd be a waste of time.

14:32.870 --> 14:34.180
Waste of time?

14:34.180 --> 14:41.910
Duplicate

