Security

14:44.180 --> 14:45.390
Wanna stop by somewhere?

14:45.390 --> 14:47.280
My legs were getting tired anyway.

14:47.230 --> 14:47.360
We can replace your keys!

14:47.230 --> 14:47.360
Duplicate Keys

14:47.230 --> 14:47.360
Security

14:47.280 --> 14:48.610
Why did I even take you along?

14:47.360 --> 14:47.440
We can replace your keys!

14:49.140 --> 14:50.720
I'm getting tired of walking.

14:50.740 --> 14:50.860
Duplicate Keys

14:51.200 --> 14:53.340
You're so worthless.

14:54.200 --> 14:56.470
So, why are you sitting so far away from me?

14:56.940 --> 14:58.020
I just feel like it.

14:58.020 --> 15:00.140
It's inconvenient for other people.

15:04.440 --> 15:06.840
There's no one around us, anyway...

15:08.070 --> 15:10.080
This place gets packed easily.

15:10.080 --> 15:11.800
Is that so?

15:11.800 --> 15:13.030
Yeah.

15:18.250 --> 15:21.440
The bun is misaligned, and even the lettuce is falling out…

15:21.440 --> 15:23.290
What is this mess?

15:24.490 --> 15:25.170
There.

15:25.170 --> 15:26.340
Thanks for the food.

15:28.670 --> 15:30.340
Do you dislike pickles?

15:30.910 --> 15:33.130
They seem like an ingredient for kids.

15:33.130 --> 15:36.020
Actually, I'm pretty sure a lot of people don't like them.

15:36.020 --> 15:38.530
Masato can't eat anything sour...

15:38.530 --> 15:40.670
And he doesn't seem to like tomatoes.

15:40.670 --> 15:41.980
He doesn't like tomatoes either?

15:41.980 --> 15:43.510
Nope.

15:44.300 --> 15:46.730
That has a lot of tomatoes in it though.

15:46.730 --> 15:47.980
I'm fine with ketchup.

15:47.980 --> 15:50.440
I also really like red fruits.

15:50.440 --> 15:51.940
Like apples?

15:51.940 --> 15:52.840
Yeah.

15:52.840 --> 15:54.030
I like them.

15:55.950 --> 15:56.990
Also...

15:57.250 --> 16:00.600
Kanata means "apple of the field."

16:00.600 --> 16:04.750
It means "expected to ripen well," or something like that.

16:08.180 --> 16:09.840
The origin of your name?

16:11.220 --> 16:12.310
Yes.

16:12.310 --> 16:13.220
The origin.

16:16.840 --> 16:19.490
I wonder if A-chan-senpai got tired of waiting for us.

16:20.100 --> 16:22.220
Hold on a second, Futaki-san!

16:26.930 --> 16:28.660
I was thinking this earlier, but...

16:28.660 --> 16:31.210
That smile doesn't seem very genuine.

16:31.210 --> 16:33.110
That's because it's not.

16:33.840 --> 16:35.980
It'd be nice if you just smiled normally...

16:35.980 --> 16:40.470
It's fine with me but it might affect your reputation with others.

16:40.470 --> 16:42.450
You're really nosy, aren't you?

16:43.900 --> 16:50.590
Also, the way you call me by my full name, "Naoe Riki," gives me a bad impression.

16:50.590 --> 16:53.590
Well, that was my intention.

16:53.590 --> 16:56.300
Whoa, so it actually was.

16:56.900 --> 16:58.350
"Was" her intention?

17:03.480 --> 17:06.780
How can I call you normally?

17:07.610 --> 17:08.900
Um...

17:15.330 --> 17:17.410
By my last name, like everyone else.

17:23.110 --> 17:25.430
N-Nao...

17:27.200 --> 17:28.080
Naoe!

17:28.080 --> 17:32.550
See, I don't really get why you yell it out like that.

17:37.010 --> 17:39.440
Thanks to everyone's best efforts...

17:39.440 --> 17:42.300
We've managed to keep the room until the next maintenance.

17:42.300 --> 17:44.300
Do they still need help?

17:44.300 --> 17:46.240
Do they need muscles or something?

17:46.240 --> 17:50.190
No, I was actually thinking of having Futaki help us gather support.

17:50.190 --> 17:51.860
Why Futaki-san?

17:51.860 --> 17:55.640
Futaki is also in charge of the sports club meeting paperwork.

17:55.640 --> 17:57.860
She's doing that, too?

17:57.860 --> 18:01.860
She's the vice president of the girls' kendo club and their team captain.

18:01.860 --> 18:03.230
Former vice president, that is.

18:03.230 --> 18:04.620
Right now, she's only a member in name.

18:04.920 --> 18:07.500
So Futaki-san used to participate in kendo...

18:07.500 --> 18:09.960
You're surprisingly well-informed about it, Masato.

18:09.960 --> 18:11.370
What's wrong, Riki?

18:11.370 --> 18:15.460
"This muscle idiot probably only knows that because he went to the girls' kendo club"

18:15.460 --> 18:19.950
"thinking they'd have an idea of Kengo's weakness so he can beat him, how good for him,"

18:19.950 --> 18:21.090
is what you want to say, isn't it?

18:21.090 --> 18:22.560
No, no, no, no...

18:22.560 --> 18:24.470
But will she do that for us?

18:24.470 --> 18:28.430
Certainly, she does seem to see us in a bad light.

18:29.000 --> 18:30.560
It'll be all right.

18:30.560 --> 18:34.050
I'm pretty sure if we explain our situation to her, she'll understand.

18:35.820 --> 18:37.360
Oh, there she is!

18:39.700 --> 18:43.200
Once you're done baking it, hold it upside-down like this.

18:43.200 --> 18:43.710
Huh?

18:43.710 --> 18:44.790
What for?

18:44.790 --> 18:48.040
If you don't, it won't be fluffy.

18:48.690 --> 18:51.520
Is that so? Now I get it...

18:51.520 --> 18:53.420
You don't seem like you do...

18:56.360 --> 18:57.380
Riki-kun!

18:57.730 --> 18:58.840
Naoe.

18:59.700 --> 19:00.590
Huh?

19:01.050 --> 19:02.090
What?

19:02.090 --> 19:04.870
Well, you said my name really naturally.

19:04.870 --> 19:07.390
Of course I did. I practiced doing so.

19:10.680 --> 19:12.070
Um... n—

19:12.070 --> 19:13.290
Never mind that.

19:13.290 --> 19:14.400
Goodbye.

19:14.730 --> 19:17.190
Thanks for teaching me, onee-chan!

19:18.360 --> 19:20.320
Make sure you don't eat the burnt one.

19:24.280 --> 19:26.060
We're making tempura today.

19:26.060 --> 19:27.480
Come by and eat some!

19:27.480 --> 19:28.550
Awesome!

19:28.550 --> 19:29.750
Excuse me, you two.

19:29.750 --> 19:31.300
The cooking club?

19:31.300 --> 19:32.620
Y-Yes?

19:33.350 --> 19:35.700
Be careful when using the stove.

19:40.280 --> 19:42.140
Isn't that great, Naoe-kun?

19:42.140 --> 19:43.680
She called out to you normally.

19:44.010 --> 19:45.180
I guess...

19:45.180 --> 19:48.560
Now you can finally call her
"Kana-tan" to your heart's content!

19:48.560 --> 19:50.020
I'm not calling her that.

19:57.330 --> 19:59.840
Is Futaki-san not coming today?

19:59.840 --> 20:00.580
What's wrong?

20:00.580 --> 20:01.950
Are you lonely without her?

20:01.950 --> 20:04.100
Please stop teasing me.

20:04.100 --> 20:05.070
Sorry, sorry.

20:05.500 --> 20:08.530
Kana-chan said she'd come after she's finished her campus patrol.

20:08.950 --> 20:11.110
Let's finish off with the cooking club.

20:11.110 --> 20:11.880
Yes, ma’am.

20:18.370 --> 20:19.150
Get outside!

20:19.150 --> 20:19.890
Hurry!

20:23.310 --> 20:24.130
Chairman!

20:24.450 --> 20:25.180
What happened?

20:25.180 --> 20:25.890
Fire?!

20:26.200 --> 20:28.140
The chairman is inside there.

20:29.140 --> 20:30.290
Futaki-san!

20:33.290 --> 20:34.750
I'm fine.

20:34.750 --> 20:36.400
The fire's been put out.

20:46.200 --> 20:47.830
What are those marks?

20:52.060 --> 20:53.370
Did she get burned?

21:01.820 --> 21:03.510
How disgusting.

21:05.800 --> 21:06.760
Futaki-san!

21:33.510 --> 21:34.120
Are you—

21:34.430 --> 21:35.290
Don't touch me!

21:37.040 --> 21:39.440
Don’t… Please don’t touch me.

21:39.440 --> 21:41.480
D-Don't get any closer to me.

21:41.480 --> 21:44.070
Get away from me...

21:45.440 --> 21:52.170
Episode 7

21:45.440 --> 21:52.170
Kanata's Secret

21:52.140 --> 21:55.310
While I ran around the bases,

21:55.600 --> 21:58.890
I suddenly stopped in my tracks

21:58.980 --> 22:05.820
To gaze at the ball that flew above my head.

22:05.900 --> 22:09.110
I wondered why

22:09.280 --> 22:12.490
I couldn’t even get that one hit,

22:12.740 --> 22:19.040
As I stood there bewildered.

22:19.370 --> 22:26.000
One point away, yet it feels so far.

22:21.130 --> 22:24.290
To the delicate eye.

22:26.170 --> 22:29.340
Don’t you feel that way too?

22:27.880 --> 22:31.300
Even if you feel like that.

22:29.720 --> 22:38.730
I wonder if I’ll be able to stand up to bat.

22:39.730 --> 22:42.560
But I know

22:42.600 --> 22:46.650
that my story from now on

22:46.650 --> 22:54.030
Is a journey for me to become as strong as you.

22:55.990 --> 23:00.710
This scene, where various ripples, forming and expanding,

23:00.290 --> 23:03.960
Are overlapping...

23:03.540 --> 23:10.720
You must not forget, these are everyone's feelings.

23:13.390 --> 23:17.180
As I look at you sitting next to me now

23:16.970 --> 23:26.190
You seem to be a little more mature.

23:31.010 --> 23:40.990
Episode 8

23:31.010 --> 23:40.990
Our Bonds

23:32.470 --> 23:33.410
Futaki-san is—

23:33.410 --> 23:34.740
Onee-chan!

23:34.740 --> 23:35.990
Let's go save her!

23:35.990 --> 23:36.880
All right!

23:36.880 --> 23:38.210
Mission start!

23:38.210 --> 23:38.990
Yeah!
